<p id="mwAm0"><b id="mwAm4"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bachelor_in_Paradise_(American_TV_series)_season_10" title="Bachelor in Paradise (American TV series) season 10" id="mwAm8">Season 10</a></b></p>

<p id="mwAnA">Jess Edwards, Lea Cayanan and Lexi Young returned for <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bachelor_in_Paradise_(American_TV_series)_season_10" title="Bachelor in Paradise (American TV series) season 10" id="mwAnE">season 10</a> of <i id="mwAnI"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bachelor_in_Paradise_(American_TV_series)" title="Bachelor in Paradise (American TV series)" id="mwAnM">Bachelor in Paradise</a></i>.<sup about="#mwt188" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-53" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-53"}}'><a href="#cite_note-53" id="mwAnQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAnU"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAnY">[</span>52<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAnc">]</span></span></a></sup> Young quit in week 2. Cayanan was eliminated alongside Jonathon Johnson in Week 8. Edwards won $190,000 and became engaged to Spencer Conley in the finale.<sup about="#mwt191" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-54" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-54"}}'><a href="#cite_note-54" id="mwAng"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAnk"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAno">[</span>53<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAns">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="8" id="mwAnw" aria-labelledby="Dancing_with_the_Stars"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading4"><h4 id="Dancing_with_the_Stars"><i id="mwAn0">Dancing with the Stars</i></h4><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=The_Bachelor_(American_TV_series)_season_28&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8" title="Edit section: Dancing with the Stars"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>

<p id="mwAn4">Graziadei and Tran competed in <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dancing_with_the_Stars_(American_season_33)" title="Dancing with the Stars (American season 33)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwAn8">season 33</a> of <i id="mwAoA"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dancing_with_the_Stars_(American_TV_series)" title="Dancing with the Stars (American TV series)" id="mwAoE">Dancing with the Stars</a></i>, partnering with <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jenna_Johnson_(dancer)" title="Jenna Johnson (dancer)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwAoI">Jenna Johnson</a> and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sasha_Farber" title="Sasha Farber" id="mwAoM">Sasha Farber</a>, respectively.<sup about="#mwt194" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-55" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-55"}}'><a href="#cite_note-55" id="mwAoQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAoU"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAoY">[</span>54<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAoc">]</span></span></a></sup> Tran finished in 7th place, and Graziadei was the winner.<sup about="#mwt197" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-56" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-56"}}'><a href="#cite_note-56" id="mwAog"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAok"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAoo">[</span>55<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAos">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="9" id="mwAow" aria-labelledby="The_Traitors"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading4"><h4 id="The_Traitors"><i id="mwAo0">The Traitors</i></h4><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=The_Bachelor_(American_TV_series)_season_28&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9" title="Edit section: The Traitors"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwAo4">In 2026, Graziadei competed on the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Traitors_(American_TV_series)_season_6" title="The Traitors (American TV series) season 6" id="mwAo8">sixth season</a> of <i id="mwApA"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Traitors_(American_TV_series)" title="The Traitors (American TV series)" id="mwApE">The Traitors</a></i>.<sup about="#mwt200" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-57" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-57"}}'><a href="#cite_note-57" id="mwApI"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwApM"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwApQ">[</span>56<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwApU">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

